# Requisições de teste para a extensão "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) do VS Code.
# Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco, na ordem.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Criar usuário (a carteira é criada junto). Rodando de novo com o mesmo e-mail dá 409.
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Souza",
  "email": "ana@email.com",
  "password": "senha1234"
}

### 2. Consultar a carteira (saldo 0.00)
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{createUser.response.body.walletId}}

### 3. Depositar 100,50
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{createUser.response.body.walletId}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: dep-001

{ "amount": 100.50 }

### 4. Reenviar o MESMO depósito (mesma Idempotency-Key): devolve a operação original, saldo não muda
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{createUser.response.body.walletId}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: dep-001

{ "amount": 100.50 }

### 5. Sacar 30
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{createUser.response.body.walletId}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 30 }

### 6. Saque maior que o saldo: 422 Saldo insuficiente
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{createUser.response.body.walletId}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 9999 }

### 7. Valor inválido (3 casas decimais): 400 Dados inválidos
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{createUser.response.body.walletId}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 10.555 }

### 8. Idempotency-Key reutilizada com outro valor: 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{createUser.response.body.walletId}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: dep-001

{ "amount": 5 }

### 9. Carteira inexistente: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
